4. Find Nth Highest Salary
Example: 3rd Highest

PySpark:

from pyspark.sql.window import Window
from pyspark.sql.functions import dense_rank

w = Window.orderBy(df.salary.desc())

result = df.withColumn(
    "rank",
    dense_rank().over(w)
).filter("rank = 3")

SQL:

SELECT *
FROM (
SELECT salary,
       DENSE_RANK() OVER
       (ORDER BY salary DESC) rnk
FROM employee
) t
WHERE rnk = 3;
